{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15592","headline":"送客往夏州 · 杨凝","name":"送客往夏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君此去过居延，古塞黄云共渺然。\n沙阔独行寻马迹，路迷遥指戍楼烟。\n夜投孤店愁吹笛，朝望行尘避控弦。\n闻有故交今从骑，何须着论更言钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}